           "Do you understand what I mean?\n"
           "OK, do you have any other questions?\r")
    goto(_0386)
    end
_034F:
    npcmsg("I’ll explain “Lamp Jump” for you.\n"
           "Your Pokémon bounce to jump high\f"
           "and touch as many Lamps as they can.\r"
           "The more Lamps they touch, the more\n"
           "points you get.\r"
           "The total points will decide the score.\r"
           "This is an event for jumpy Pokémon\n"
